 "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "and worthwhile theory but difficult to accept as", "x": 35.02, "y": 23.88, "w": 28.03, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "it doesn't take a great deal of thought to imag-", "x": 35.02, "y": 25.06, "w": 27.35, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "ine the consequences if the plan had been rum-", "x": 35.02, "y": 26.25, "w": 28.02, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "bled. Heads", "x": 53.41, "y": 27.53, "w": 7.1, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "Roberts", "x": 34.17, "y": 28.71, "w": 4.66, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "would have", "x": 53.35, "y": 28.71, "w": 6.97, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "i", "x": 41.45, "y": 30.35, "w": 0.63, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "I", "x": 43.77, "y": 30.35, "w": 0.7, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "m", "x": 49.03, "y": 30.35, "w": 1.07, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "m", "x": 50.49, "y": 30.35, "w": 1.07, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "ro", "x": 53.38, "y": 30.21, "w": 0.84, "h": 0.67, "fontSize": 5.0}, {"text": "\"", "x": 54.33, "y": 30.35, "w": 0.45, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "ed", "x": 54.88, "y": 30.21, "w": 1.03, "h": 0.67, "fontSize": 5.0}, {"text": "> Possibly", "x": 56.01, "y": 30.35, "w": 6.34, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "literally!", "x": 53.41, "y": 31.37, "w": 4.86, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "The programme's", "x": 53.32, "y": 33.51, "w": 10.15, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "run through on", "x": 53.38, "y": 34.7, "w": 8.94, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "Rendlesham", "x": 53.41, "y": 35.88, "w": 7.38, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "was fascinating", "x": 53.35, "y": 37.07, "w": 9.49, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "though brief. It", "x": 53.32, "y": 38.26, "w": 8.87, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "stood out for", "x": 53.35, "y": 39.45, "w": 7.71, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "^", "x": 45.5, "y": 40.64, "w": 0.6, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "^", "x": 46.99, "y": 40.64, "w": 0.6, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "^", "x": 48.48, "y": 40.64, "w": 0.6, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "one factor alone", "x": 53.35, "y": 40.64, "w": 9.75, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "and that was the", "x": 53.35, "y": 41.82, "w": 10.11, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "W", "x": 43.2, "y": 43.01, "w": 1.21, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "K", "x": 44.88, "y": 43.01, "w": 0.85, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "/", "x": 46.2, "y": 43.01, "w": 0.36, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "f", "x": 47.03, "y": 43.01, "w": 0.36, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "f", "x": 47.86, "y": 43.01, "w": 0.36, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "f", "x": 48.68, "y": 43.01, "w": 0.36, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "^", "x": 49.51, "y": 43.01, "w": 0.94, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "*", "x": 51.48, "y": 43.01, "w": 0.5, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "complete", "x": 53.41, "y": 43.01, "w": 5.58, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "absence of any", "x": 53.35, "y": 44.28, "w": 9.09, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "mention of the", "x": 53.38, "y": 45.47, "w": 8.72, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "Orfordness Lighthouse. This is the favourite and", "x": 34.98, "y": 46.66, "w": 28.16, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "most touted explanation offered by the debunk-", "x": 34.98, "y": 47.85, "w": 27.74, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "ing brigade as a way of explaining Rendlesham", "x": 34.98, "y": 49.04, "w": 27.92, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "and the lights seen in the forest but it was", "x": 34.95, "y": 50.22, "w": 25.1, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "never mentioned and as such, at least as far as", "x": 34.98, "y": 51.41, "w": 28.03, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "this programme was concerned, the case for", "x": 34.92, "y": 52.6, "w": 26.53, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "Rendlesham was only strengthened. Apparently", "x": 34.98, "y": 53.79, "w": 28.03, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "it was all down to American hysteria because of", "x": 34.98, "y": 54.98, "w": 28.29, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "Russia's recent invasion of Poland and the", "x": 34.98, "y": 56.16, "w": 25.01, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "outbreak of hostilities in Afghanistan.", "x": 34.95, "y": 57.35, "w": 22.06, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "Swiney", "x": 45.8, "y": 61.21, "w": 4.38, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "David Clarke put forward a fasci-", "x": 5.08, "y": 89.68, "w": 19.19, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "nating explanation for the Janus", "x": 5.08, "y": 90.85, "w": 19.12, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "case involving Sir Peter Horsley,", "x": 5.05, "y": 92.01, "w": 19.03, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "an Equerry to Prince Phillip. Acting", "x": 5.05, "y": 93.18, "w": 20.52, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "on the Prince's very keen interest", "x": 5.05, "y": 94.35, "w": 19.9, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "Sir Peter", "x": 26.25, "y": 89.19, "w": 5.2, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "Horsley", "x": 26.28, "y": 90.3, "w": 4.46, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "Both Nick Pope", "x": 64.98, "y": 14.42, "w": 9.15, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "and Andy and Dave", "x": 64.95, "y": 15.6, "w": 11.47, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "were excellent on", "x": 64.95, "y": 16.81, "w": 10.31, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": ".", "x": 82.96, "y": 16.81, "w": 0.7, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "screen and", "x": 64.95, "y": 18.0, "w": 6.77, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "accredited them-", "x": 64.95, "y": 19.19, "w": 9.92, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "selves well.", "x": 64.95, "y": 20.38, "w": 7.13, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "Dave and Andy's", "x": 64.98, "y": 22.77, "w": 9.85, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "averred intent was", "x": 64.95, "y": 23.96, "w": 10.81, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "/", "x": 78.28, "y": 23.96, "w": 0.7, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "to try to give a fair", "x": 64.92, "y": 25.15, "w": 10.75, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "| |", "x": 77.42, "y": 25.15, "w": 1.23, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "and unbiased view", "x": 64.95, "y": 26.34, "w": 11.19, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "of British Ufology", "x": 64.92, "y": 27.53, "w": 10.27, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "and in my opinion", "x": 64.92, "y": 28.71, "w": 10.68, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "r", "x": 82.77, "y": 28.71, "w": 0.77, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "they unquestion-", "x": 64.89, "y": 29.94, "w": 9.8, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "ably succeeded.", "x": 64.92, "y": 31.13, "w": 9.76, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "More of the same", "x": 64.95, "y": 33.53, "w": 10.54, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "please gents! The hoped", "x": 64.95, "y": 34.72, "w": 14.57, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "for and predicted audience", "x": 64.89, "y": 35.9, "w": 16.0, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "prior to transmission was", "x": 64.95, "y": 37.09, "w": 15.13, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "in excess of three million", "x": 64.95, "y": 38.28, "w": 14.93, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "but I read at least one", "x": 64.95, "y": 39.47, "w": 13.07, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "somewhat negative pre-", "x": 64.92, "y": 40.66, "w": 14.12, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "view", "x": 64.89, "y": 41.84, "w": 2.62, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "(Daily", "x": 67.51, "y": 41.41, "w": 3.86, "h": 1.92, "fontSize": 11.9}, {"text": "Telegraph)", "x": 71.38, "y": 41.41, "w": 7.39, "h": 1.92, "fontSize": 12.0}, {"text": "beforehand. I do hope that", "x": 64.95, "y": 43.03, "w": 15.7, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "didn't put people off, as", "x": 64.92, "y": 44.22, "w": 14.08, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "this deserved as wide an", "x": 64.89, "y": 45.41, "w": 14.96, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "audience as possible.", "x": 64.92, "y": 46.6, "w": 12.84, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "F i f e", "x": 77.4, "y": 81.1, "w": 7.99, "h": 2.83, "fontSize": 20.9}]}